      "description": "[P] Add foundational record-contract tests in `tests/test_metrics.py` before implementing the helper: cover all twelve required fields (`schema_version` exactly `1` and booleans are not integers; nonempty opaque `invocation_id` and `run_id`; exact modeled `step_id`; exact `agent_name`, `skill_id`, `workflow_id`, and nonpersonal `project_label`; `started_at` and `finished_at` exactly `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.mmmZ`; signed integer `duration_ms`) and optional nullable `model` and `effort` (absent normalizes to null; present values are null or nonempty strings); cover `invocation_kind` exactly `execution`, `continuation`, `retry`, or `probe`; reject missing/empty strings, booleans or fractions in integer fields, duplicate JSON keys, nonfinite numeric constants, impossible timestamps, unsupported schema/kind, and mismatched duration arithmetic; verify equal/backward clock readings and the 65,536-byte JSON, 32,767-character and legal-XML-text limits without trimming or truncation against `specs/022-local-workflow-agent-timing-metrics/data-model.md` and `contracts/metric-record.md`.",
